[I] Perl module implementing a JSON encoder/decoder

[T] JSON is a Perl module for encoding and decoding JSON (JavaScript Object
[T] Notation) text. It provides simple encode_json and decode_json functions
[T] and an object oriented interface, and uses JSON::XS or Cpanel::JSON::XS
[T] when available, falling back to the pure Perl JSON::PP.

[U] https://metacpan.org/release/JSON

[A] Perl-json Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

